5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Let's begin by establishing a logical framework. We need to identify the werewolf and the possessed by looking for inconsistencies in our statements.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready! I'll find the bad guys no matter what. Just tell me who looks suspicious!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mio,,"Hehe, Takumi is so energetic! I hope we can all just get along while we figure this out. It's a bit scary, isn't it?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,Emotional appeals are useless here. We should focus on who is trying too hard to blend in. I'll be observing everyone closely.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Minako,,I agree with Asuka. Let's keep our discussions grounded in facts. We should decide how to handle contradictions when they arise.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"If someone changes their story, we should mark them immediately. Consistency is the only way to verify a human's identity.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"Yeah! If you lie, I'll know! @Mio, why are you acting so carefree?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mio,,"Aww, Takumi! I'm just trying to keep the mood light so we don't all freak out. That's not lying, right?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,"It's a common tactic to use cheerfulness as a shield. However, it's too early to draw conclusions. Let's see who claims the Seer role first.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Minako,,Let's not jump to conclusions. We should allow the Seer to gather information before we start accusing people based on personality.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,I agree with Minako. A premature accusation could lead us to execute a villager. We need a clear signal from the Seer.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"Fine, but I'm still watching you, Mio!","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mio,,"I'll be a good girl, I promise! @Minako, you seem so calm, I feel safe when you're leading us.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Flattery is another red flag. But for now, I'll remain silent and analyze the flow of this conversation.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Minako,,"Thank you, Mio. I will do my best to ensure we make a rational decision tomorrow.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Asuka,,Then we are agreed. We prioritize logical consistency and wait for the Seer's lead.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
