36,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"The first night has passed. If the Seer found something, now is the time to consider how to present that information.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Come on! Who is it? @Shion, you were acting all smart, did you find anything?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Mio,,I hope everyone is okay! I had a bad dream that someone was being mean. Let's be careful!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I have a very clear result. Mio, your cheerful act is quite transparent. You are the werewolf.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Minako,,"That is a bold claim, Shion. Do you have any proof other than your role as the Seer?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"If Shion is the Seer, his information is absolute. However, the werewolf could also claim to be the Seer to frame someone.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"What?! So Shion might be the liar? I can't tell who to believe! @Mio, are you really the wolf?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Mio,,What?! No way! Shion is lying! I'm just a normal girl! Why would he say that? I'm so sad!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Crying is a classic defense mechanism. My divination doesn't lie. The logic is simple: I am the Seer, and Mio is the enemy.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Minako,,We must consider the possibility of a fake Seer. But Shion's confidence is consistent with his personality.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Asuka,,Mio's reaction is purely emotional. She hasn't provided a counter-argument or a claim to a role.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Takumi,,She is just crying! That's not a proof! I think I believe Shion!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, how could you! I thought we were friends! @Minako, please tell them I'm innocent!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Shion,,Notice how she appeals to Minako. She's trying to find a protector to sway the vote.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I am listening to both sides. However, Mio, your lack of a logical defense makes Shion's claim more plausible.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"The evidence points toward Mio. Unless someone else claims to be the Seer, Shion's lead is the most logical path.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm voting for Mio! Sorry, Mio, but Shion seems sure!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Mio,,This is unfair! You're all being so mean to me! I'm not the werewolf!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Shion,,Your desperation only confirms my result. Let's end this now.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Minako,,I agree. The risk of keeping Mio is higher than the risk of trusting Shion.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
